(One common mistake is to stop an ongoing SIP or redeem a long-term investment merely because markets have) Tj
T* (fallen. Another is trying to time the market - exiting with the hope of re-entering lower, or waiting indefinitely for the) Tj
T* ("right" level to invest.) Tj
